================================================================================
Alpine Linux base image
================================================================================

Both images are built FROM alpine:3.23 and install `ca-certificates`, `curl`,
`jq`, `libqrencode-tools`, `nftables`, and `iproute2` from the Alpine package
repositories. Those packages are distributed under their own licenses; run
`apk info -L <package>` inside the image for per-package details.
